\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0018/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g013\", \"description\": \"春秋金文「齋」\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0018/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g014\", \"description\": \"战国简帛「齋」\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0018/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g015\", \"description\": \"小篆「齋」\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0018/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g016\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书「齋」第1例\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0018/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g017\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书「斋」异体第2例（从示从齐）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0018/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g018\", \"description\": \"古文字「齐」之形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0018/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g019\", \"description\": \"战国文字下加两横之「齐」\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0018/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g020\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书异体「斋」（从示从齐）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0018/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g021\", \"description\": \"西周金文「禋」\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0018/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g022\", \"description\": \"春秋金文「禋」\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0018/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g023\", \"description\": \"《说文》古文「禋」\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0018/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g024\", \"description\": \"小篆「禋」\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0018/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g025\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书「禋」\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0018/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n19:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:000019\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 19, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"2120f89f04c5944780123e0f53eaad0489fcd2d44eb738eae498932af86c022a\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"d065594380a447734a338ce18500a96dbc3e6ccd33b76687792d51a89e586696\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"禔 神 祇 祕 齋 裡 祭 祀 柴 襯\\n\\n1、2《金文编》11页。3、4《说文》8页。5《篆隶表》10页。\\n形声字。从示，覀声。本义是指一种祭名。古人升烟以祭天，先烧柴升烟，再加牲体及玉帛于柴上焚烧，因烟气上达以致精诚。《周礼·春官·大宗伯》：“以裡祀祀昊天上帝。”郑玄注：“裡之言烟，周人尚臭，烟，气之臭闻者……三祀皆积柴实牲体焉，或有玉帛，燔燎而升烟，所以报阳也。”墙盘：“乂其裡祀。”嘉鼎：“是唯哀成叔之鼎，永用裡祀。”“裡”字即用此义。引申之也泛指虔诚的祭祀。《说文》：“裡，洁祀也。一日精意以享为裡。”蔡侯盘：“裡享是以。”“裡”字即用此义。西周文字中“裡”字从宀、从示、从火，西声；或从宀，煙(烟)声。春秋文字则演变为从示西声。战国文字继承春秋文字，但仍保留西周文字中的“宀”旁，秦代及秦代以后的“裡”字则是春秋“裡”字的延续，虽书体有变化，但字形结构未变。（白于蓝）\\n\\n祭 jì 精纽、月部；精纽、祭韵、子例切。\\nzhài 精纽、月部；庄纽、怪韵、侧界切。\\n[glyph:g001] 商\\n[glyph:g002] 商\\n[glyph:g003] 西周\\n[glyph:g004] 春秋\\n[glyph:g005] 春秋\\n[glyph:g006] 战国\\n[glyph:g007] 战国\\n[glyph:g008] 《说文》小篆\\n[glyph:g009] 汉\\n祭 楷书\\n\\n1、2《甲文编》8页。3-6《金文编》11页。7《楚系简帛》21页。8《说文》8页。9《篆隶表》11页。\\n会意字。从示，从又，从肉。始见于甲骨文。本义是指祭祀。《说文》：“祭，祭祀也。”《合集》22692：“丁卯卜，即贞：王宾报丁，祭，亡尤？”（丁卯这一天占卜，由即这个人贞问：商王若迎导报丁的神灵，举行祭祀，不会有灾祸吗？）金文栾书缶：“以祭我皇祖。”这种用法的“祭”今天读jì。甲骨文中早期的“祭”字作“[glyph:g010]”，从又、从肉，会以手持肉祭祀之意，上下小点表示血滴。晚期甲骨文追加“示”旁，并将“肉”旁变为“口”形。西周金文承袭甲骨文晚期的写法，但将“肉”旁变为“[glyph:g011]”形。春秋、战国、秦代以及汉代文字中基本沿袭西周文字的写法。但在春秋、战国时期，“祭”字所从的“又”旁或可写作“[glyph:g012]”、“[glyph:g013]”，乃“攴”字。这是因为古文字中，“又”、“攴”、“殳”等字在用作表意偏旁时常可互换的缘故。现代文字基本沿袭汉代“祭”字的写法，只是将“又”旁省变为“又”形。春秋时期，在今天河南郑州东北有一个祭国，“祭国”之“祭”今天读zhài。（白于蓝）\\n\\n祀 sì 邪纽、之部；邪纽、止韵、详里切。\\n[glyph:g014] 商\\n[glyph:g015] 商\\n[glyph:g016] 西周\\n[glyph:g017] 西周\\n[glyph:g018] 春秋\\n[glyph:g019] 战国\\n[glyph:g020] 战国\\n[glyph:g021] 《说文》小篆\\n[glyph:g022] 《说文》或体\\n[glyph:g023] 汉\\n祀 楷书\\n\\n1、2《甲文编》8页。3《金文编》11页。4、5《类编》174页。6、7《古字典》64页。8、9《说文》8页。10《篆隶表》11页。\\n形声字。从示，巳声。始见于甲骨文。本义是指永久祭祀。《说文》：“祀，祭无已也。”徐锴系传：“《老子》曰：‘子孙祭祀不辍’是也。”智鼎：“智其万(年)用祀。”“祀”字即用此义。引申之则泛指祭祀。《国语·周语上》：“夫祀，国之大节也。”甲骨文《殷契佚存》：“其祀多先祖。”金文天亡簋：“王祀于天室。”“祀”即指祭祀而言。“祀”字历代字形一脉相承，变化不是很大，只是在西周和战国文字中有在声旁“巳”字上加“[glyph:g024]”和“[glyph:g025]”为饰笔。在秦代文字中，“祀”字还出现了“[glyph:g026]”这种异体。甲骨文中“祀”与“巳”有时可以通用。《小屯·殷墟文字乙编》2587：“庚寅卜，争贞：极其祀于河。”《战后南北所见甲骨录·南北坊间所见甲骨录》3.35：“贞：巳河。”“祀”字可能是“巳”字之孳乳分化字。关于“巳”字之字形演变，参见“巳”字条。（白于蓝）\\n\\n柴 chái 崇纽、支部；崇纽、佳韵、士佳切。\\n[glyph:g027] 《说文》古文\\n[glyph:g028] 《说文》小篆\\n柴 楷书\\n\\n1、2《说文》8页。\\n形声字。从示，此声。本义是指焚柴祭天，也作“柴”。《说文》：“柴，烧柴焚燎以祭天神。”《集韵·佳韵》：“柴，通作柴。”《史记·五帝本纪》：“东巡守，至于岱宗，柴。”裴骃集解引郑玄曰：“柴，燎也。”《说文》古文“柴”字“从隋省”声。“隋”、“此”古音相近，故“柴”或可从“隋”声作。（白于蓝）\\n\\n衬 fù 并纽、侯部；奉纽、遇韵、符遇切。\\n[glyph:g029] 《说文》小篆\\n[glyph:g030] 汉\\n衬 楷书\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"甲骨文‘祭’字字形，商代\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"甲骨文‘祭’字字形，商代，带示部\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"金文‘祭’字字形，西周\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"金文‘祭’字字形，春秋\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"春秋‘祭’字异体字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g006\", \"description\": \"战国‘祭’字字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g007\", \"description\": \"战国‘祭’字异体字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g008\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆‘祭’字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g009\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书‘祭’字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g010\", \"description\": \"早期甲骨文‘祭’字形，从又从肉无示旁\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g011\", \"description\": \"西周金文‘祭’字中演变之肉旁字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g012\", \"description\": \"春秋战国‘祭’字所从攴旁异体\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g013\", \"description\": \"春秋战国‘祭’字所从攴旁异体\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g014\", \"description\": \"甲骨文‘祀’字字形，商代\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g015\", \"description\": \"甲骨文‘祀’字字形，商代\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g016\", \"description\": \"金文‘祀’字字形，西周\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g017\", \"description\": \"金文‘祀’字带饰笔字形，西周\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g018\", \"description\": \"金文‘祀’字字形，春秋\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g019\", \"description\": \"战国文字‘祀’字字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g020\", \"description\": \"战国文字‘祀’字带饰笔字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g021\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆‘祀’字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g022\", \"description\": \"《说文》或体‘祀’字，从示从禠省/禋省声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g023\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书‘祀’字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g024\", \"description\": \"西周文字‘祀’字声旁‘巳’上所加饰笔符号\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g025\", \"description\": \"战国文字‘祀’字声旁‘巳’上所加饰笔符号\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g026\", \"description\": \"秦代‘祀’字异体小篆字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g027\", \"description\": \"《说文》古文‘柴’字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g028\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆‘柴’字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g029\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆‘衬’字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g030\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书‘衬’字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n20:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:000020\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 20, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"3033fb8437586d2c5d1f7cb3503ee813d456f0f88ba8d338fa2bb71f1266bc2c\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"296655174125906cfb196ced151efdb58c50e9c16dbdd21ace0f0588c23e227c\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"示部\\n\\n1《说文》8页。2《篆隶表》11页。\\n形声字。从示,付声。本义是一种祭名,新死之人附祭于先祖。《说文》:“祔,后死者合食于先祖。”《尔雅·释诂下》:“祔,祖也。”郭璞注:“祔,付也。付新死者于祖庙。”《释名·释丧制》:“祭曰祔。祭于祖庙,以后死孙祔于祖也。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n祖 zǔ 精组、鱼部;精组、姥韵、则古切。\\n\\n[glyph:g001]¹ 商\\n[glyph:g002]² 西周\\n[glyph:g003]³ 春秋\\n[glyph:g004]⁴ 战国\\n[glyph:g005]⁵ 战国\\n[glyph:g006]⁶ 战国\\n[glyph:g007]⁷ 《说文》小篆\\n[glyph:g008]⁸ 汉\\n祖 楷书\\n\\n1《甲文编》9页。2、3《金文编》12、13页。4《楚系简帛》22页。5《战文编》7页。6《金文编》13页。7《说文》8页。8《篆隶表》11页。\\n形声字。从示,且声。甲骨文和西周金文中以“且”为“祖”,不从“示”。关于“且”字之造字本义,有多种说法,或云是男性生殖器之象形,或说是像神主之形,尚无定论。古文字中“祖”字是指祖先而言,凡父辈以上皆可称“祖”。《诗·大雅·生民序》:“《生民》,尊祖也。”孔颖达疏:“祖之定名,父之父耳。但祖者,始也,己所从始也,自父之父以上皆得称焉。”“祖”字应当是由“且”分化出来的专用字。后世“且”用为虚词,不再用来表示“祖先”之义。这种分化大概是在春秋时代完成的,所以春秋文字中“祖”字已作“[glyph:g009]”。战国文字在春秋文字的基础上发生一些变化,主要表现在声旁“且”字上,或加一短横为饰笔,或加“又”旁繁化,并在“且”旁右边加“[glyph:g010]”为饰笔;或将“且”声改为“䖈”声。秦汉以后的“祖”字基本沿袭春秋文字的写法,变化不大。参见“且”字条。(白于蓝)\\n\\n絭 bēng 帮组、阳部;帮组、庚韵、甫盲切。\\n\\n[glyph:g011]¹ 《说文》小篆\\n絭 楷书\\n[glyph:g012]² 《说文》或体\\n[glyph:g013] 楷书\\n\\n1、2《说文》8页。\\n形声字。从示,彭声。或作禓,从示,方声。始见于秦代文字。本义是指宗庙门内设祭之处。《说文》:“絭,门内祭先祖所以徬徨。从示,彭声。《诗》曰:‘祝祭于絭。’禓,絭或从方。”《诗·小雅·楚茨》:“祝祭于祊,祀事孔明。”毛传:“祊,门内也。”《左传·襄公二十四年》:“保始受氏,以守宗祊。”杜预注:“祊,庙门。”《礼记·郊特牲》:“索祭祝于祊。”孔颖达疏:“凡祊有二种:一是正祭之时,既设祭于庙,又求神于庙门之内……二是明日绎祭之时,设馔于庙门外西室,亦谓之祊。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n祏 shí 禅组、铎部;禅组、昔韵、常只切。\\n\\n[glyph:g014]¹ 商\\n[glyph:g015]² 商\\n[glyph:g016]³ 《说文》小篆\\n祏 楷书\\n\\n1、2《甲文编》9页。2《说文》8页。\\n会意兼形声字。从示、从石,石亦声。始见于甲骨文。本义是指古代宗庙中藏神主的石匣。《说文》:“祏,宗庙主也。周礼有郊宗石室。”徐灏注笺:“宗庙主藏于石室,谓之宗祏。浑言之,则祏曰宗庙主,非谓祏即主也。”《玉篇·示部》:“祏,庙主石室也。”《左传·昭公十八年》:“使祝史徙主祏于周庙。”杜预注:“祏,庙主石函。”孔颖达疏:“每庙木主皆以石函盛之,当祭则出之,事毕则纳于函,藏于庙之北壁之内,所以辟火灾也。”甲骨文之“祏”均用作祭名,如《铁云藏龟》121.2:“[glyph:g017]亥卜,殻贞:祏南庚……”([glyph:g018]亥这一天占卜,由殻这个人贞问:是否祏祭南庚……)“南庚”是商王祖先名。(白于蓝)\\n\\n妣 bǐ 帮组、脂部;帮组、旨韵、卑履切。\\n\\n[glyph:g019]¹ 春秋\\n[glyph:g020]² 《说文》小篆\\n妣 楷书\\n\\n1《金文编》13页。2《说文》8页。\\n形声字。从示,比声。本义是指用小猪祭司命神。《说文》:“妣,以豚祠司命。从示,比声。《汉律》曰:‘祠妣司命。’”段玉裁注:“《风俗通义》曰:‘《周礼》司命,文昌也。今民间祀司命,刻木长尺二寸为人像,行者担箧中,居者别作小屋。齐地大尊重之,汝南余郡亦多有,皆祠以腊,率以春秋之月。’按,腊同猪,许所谓豚也。”春秋文字中的“妣”从“ [glyph:g021] (匕)”声。“匕”乃匕柶之象形,与“比”同音,故“妣”亦可从匕声。此“妣”字见于春秋金文齐铸当中,通借为“考妣”之“妣”,其文句是:“输保其身,用享用孝于皇祖圣叔、皇䣥(妣)圣妾,于皇祖又成惠叔、皇妣\\n\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"甲骨文“且”字形，柱状神主之形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"西周金文“且”字形，上下有横画托底与冠饰\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"春秋金文“祖”字形，左示右且\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"战国楚系文字“祖”字形，从示从䖈\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"战国文字“祖”字形，左示右且，且字上部加横笔与饰笔\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g006\", \"description\": \"战国金文“祖”字形，左示，右边且旁加又及饰笔\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g007\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“祖”字形，左示右且\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g008\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书/篆隶“祖”字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g009\", \"description\": \"春秋金文“祖”字形，文本中引用\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g010\", \"description\": \"战国金文祖字中添加的类似“公”或八形的饰笔\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g011\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“絭”字形，从示彭声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g012\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆或体“禓”字形，从示方声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g013\", \"description\": \"楷书“祊”字形，左示右方\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g014\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文“祏”字形，示与石合文\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g015\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文“祏”字形另一种异体，示与石合文\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g016\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“祏”字形，左示右石\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g017\", \"description\": \"卜辞干支缺字框（方框）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g018\", \"description\": \"卜辞干支缺字框（方框）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g019\", \"description\": \"春秋金文“妣”字形，左示右匕\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g020\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“妣”字形，左示右比\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g021\", \"description\": \"古文字“匕”形，匕柶之象形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n21:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:000021\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 21, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"e0949c9b4fa2b89bd552706da4089c0053ef3c846e8b340daa32b4735912a093\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"578bc7c3d41ed77ca4facf6106f2f1d2ac6b0ac5c39d3ed0abf6c6d7b0cd958a\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"祖 祟 祐 祉 祠 禸 禘 祫 裸 祝\\n\\n(妣)又成惠姜、皇丂(考)逆中(仲)、皇母。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n祠 cí 邪组、之部;邪组、之韵、似兹切。\\n[glyph:g001]¹ [glyph:g002]² [glyph:g003]³ 祠\\n春秋 战国 《说文》小篆 楷书\\n1、2《汉语字形表》9页。3《说文》8页。\\n形声字。从示,司声。始见于春秋文字。本义是一种祭名,指春祭。《说文》:“祠,春祭曰祠,品物少,多文词也。从示,司声。仲春之月,祠不用牺牲,用圭璧及皮币。”《尔雅·释天》:“春祭曰祠。”引申之亦可泛指祭祀。《尔雅·释诂》:“祠,祭也。”《战国策·齐策二》:“楚有祠者。”高诱注:“祠,祭也。”禹邦玉壶:“以为祠器。”中山王圜壶:“雨(雩)祠先王。”“祠”字即用此义。(白于蓝)\\n\\n禸 yuè 喻组、药部;以组、药韵、以灼切。\\n[glyph:g004]³ 禴\\n汉 楷书\\n[glyph:g005]¹ [glyph:g006]² [glyph:g007]⁴ 禸\\n商 《说文》小篆 汉 楷书\\n1《金文编》13页。2《说文》8页。3、4《篆隶表》12页。\\n形声字。从示,勺声。本义是一种祭名。夏、商两代春祭曰禸,周代夏祭曰禸。《说文》:“禸,夏祭也。”《礼记·王制》:“天子诸侯宗庙之祭,春曰祠,夏曰禸,秋曰尝,冬曰烝。”郑玄注:“此盖夏殷之祭名,周则改之,春曰祠,夏曰禸。”汉代文字中“禸”字开始出现从示侖声的异体。《尔雅·释天》:“夏祭曰禸。”陆德明释文:“本或作禴。”禴字亦一直沿用至今。(白于蓝)\\n\\n禘 dì 定组、锡韵;定组、霁韵、特计切。\\n[glyph:g008]¹ 禘\\n《说文》小篆 楷书\\n1《说文》8页。\\n形声字。从示,帝声。本义是一种祭名。《说文》:“禘,谛祭也。”段玉裁注:“禘有三,有时禘,有殷禘,有大禘。”大禘是指郊祭祭天。《诗·商颂·长发序》:“长发,大禘也。”郑玄笺:“大禘,郊祭天也。”孔颖达疏:“禘者,祭天之名。”殷禘是指宗庙五年一次的大祭。《尔雅·释天》:“禘,大祭也。”郭璞注:“五年一大祭。”时禘是宗庙四时祭之一。《礼记·王制》:“天子诸侯宗庙之祭,春曰祠,夏曰禘,秋曰尝,冬曰烝。”甲骨文中以“帝”假借为“禘”,如《京都大学人文科学研究所藏甲骨文字》2142:“于泞帝(禘),乎御羌方于止,气(灾)?”(“于泞帝(禘)”即指在泞这个地方举行禘祭)金文中则以“[glyph:g009](啻)”假借为“禘”,如刺鼎:“用牲于大室,啻(禘)邵(昭)王。”“啻”字在“帝”字之下增加了“[glyph:g010](口)”旁,是“帝”字的繁文。(白于蓝)\\n\\n祫 xiá 匣组、缉部;匣组、洽韵、侯来切。\\n[glyph:g011]¹ 祫\\n《说文》小篆 楷书\\n1《说文》8页。\\n会意兼形声字。从示,从合,合亦声。本义是一种祭名,三年举行一次的集合远近祖先神主的大型祭祀。《说文》:“祫,大合祭先祖亲疏远近也。”《春秋·文公二年》:“八月,丁卯,大事于庙。”《公羊传·文公二年》:“大事者何?大祫也。大祫者何?合祭也……毁庙之主,陈于大祖。未毁庙之主,皆升,合食于大祖。五年而再殷祭。”何休注:“殷,盛也。谓三年祫,五年禘。”《礼记·曾子问》:“祫祭于祖。”孔颖达疏:“祫,合祭。祖,大祖。三年一祫。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n裸 guàn 见组、元部;见组、换韵、古玩切。\\n[glyph:g012]¹ 裸\\n《说文》小篆 楷书\\n1《说文》8页。\\n形声字。从示,果声。本义是一种祭名,酌酒灌地之礼。《说文》:“裸,灌祭也。”《书·洛诰》:“王入太室裸。”孔颖达疏:“王以圭瓒酌郁鬯之酒以献尸,尸受祭而灌于地,因奠不饮谓之裸。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n祝 zhù 章组、觉部;章组、屋韵、之六切。\\n[glyph:g013]¹\\n商\\n[glyph:g014]² [glyph:g015]³ [glyph:g016]⁴ [glyph:g017]⁵ [glyph:g018]⁶ [glyph:g019]⁷ [glyph:g020]⁸ 祝\\n商 西周 西周 春秋 战国 《说文》小篆 汉 楷书\\n1《甲文编》364页。2《甲文编》10页。3、4《金文编》13页。5《类编》175页。6《楚系简\\n9\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0021/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0021/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0021/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"春秋时代「祠」的古文字形，左示右司\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0021/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"战国时代「祠」的古文字形，左示右司\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0021/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆「祠」\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0021/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书「禴」字，左示右侖\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0021/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"商代古文字「禸」\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0021/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g006\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆「禸」\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0021/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g007\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书「禸」\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0021/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g008\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆「禘」\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0021/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g009\", \"description\": \"金文中带有口部的帝字异体（啻）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0021/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g010\", \"description\": \"金文「口」字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0021/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g011\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆「祫」\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0021/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g012\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆「裸」\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0021/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g013\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文「祝」字异体（一长条形）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0021/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g014\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文「祝」字，跪坐人形向示祭祀\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0021/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g015\", \"description\": \"西周金文「祝」字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0021/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g016\", \"description\": \"西周金文「祝」字异体\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0021/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g017\", \"description\": \"春秋时期金文「祝」字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0021/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g018\", \"description\": \"战国楚简等古文字「祝」\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0021/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g019\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆「祝」\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0021/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g020\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书「祝」\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0021/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n23:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:000023\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 23, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"2ffd8519cb4e5c8251771b6fe944350c33fb36b6a759d1d664c0ca8614abf755\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"f20dfec361e5d5785b9c775b484417b423e88e91ccb0970e46f20067cb51837f\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"祓祈禱祭禳禪禦栝禖挀\\n\\n禳 ráng 日纽、阳部；日纽、阳韵、汝阳切。\\n[glyph:g001]¹一[glyph:g002]²一禳\\n《说文》小篆 汉 楷书\\n1《说文》8页。2《篆隶表》12页。\\n形声字。从示,襄声。本义是一种祭名,指消除灾邪的祭祀。《说文》:“禳,磔禳祀,除疠殃也。”王筠句读:“禳自是祭名。云磔禳祀者,谓磔牲以禳之之祀名曰禳也。”《广韵·阳韵》:“禳,除殃祭也。”《周礼·天官·女祝》:“掌以时招梗禬禳之事,以除疾殃。”郑玄注:“却变异曰禳。禳,攘也。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n禪(禅) shàn 禅纽、元部；禅纽、线韵、时战切。\\nchán 禅纽、元部；禅纽、仙韵、市连切。\\n[glyph:g003]¹一[glyph:g004]²一禪一禅\\n《说文》小篆 汉 楷书 楷书\\n1《说文》9页。2《篆隶表》12页。\\n形声字。从示,單声。本义是指祭天。《说文》:“禪,祭天也。”又指古代帝王让位给别人,即禅让。汉王充《论衡·正说》:“尧老求禅,四岳举舜。”这两种意思的“禅”今天读shàn。“禅”还是佛教用语“禅那”的略称,意为静思,是佛教的一种修行方式。如“坐禅”。《顿悟入道要门论》:“问:云何为禅,云何为定?答:妄念不生为禅,坐见本性为定。”这种意思的“禅”今天读chán。(白于蓝)\\n\\n禦(御) yù 疑纽、鱼部；疑纽、语韵、鱼巨切。\\n[glyph:g005]¹ [glyph:g007]³一[glyph:g008]⁴一[glyph:g009]⁵一[glyph:g010]⁶一禦\\n商 商 西周 《说文》小篆 汉 楷书\\n[glyph:g006]²\\n商\\n1、2《甲文编》76页。3《甲文编》11页。4《金文编》16页。5《说文》9页。6《篆隶表》13页。\\n形声字。从示,御声。本义是指除灾殃的一种祭祀。《说文》:“禦,祀也。”“禦”字在甲骨文中已出现,大多也是当禦祭讲。禦祭的内容十分广泛,或祈雨、或禦水、或禦疾,等等,均为禦祭于先祖以求祐护。如《小屯·殷墟文字乙编》6344:“贞:禦疾身于父乙(卜问是否禦除腹病于父乙)。”引申之禦还有防禦、抵抗之义。《小尔雅·广言》:“禦,抗也。”《诗·小雅·常棣》:“外禦其侮。”《甲骨文合集》6613:“乎禦羌。”“禦羌”即抵禦羌方。甲骨文中的“禦”字作“[glyph:g011]”、“[glyph:g012]”(卸),从“[glyph:g013]”(卩)像人跪拜祭祷之形,从“[glyph:g014]”、“[glyph:g015]”(午)为声符(禦、午上古音均为疑纽鱼部字)。之后增加“示”旁为义符,使“禦”变为从示卸声的形声字。西周时代,由于“午”字演变为“[glyph:g016]”,所以“禦”字也作“[glyph:g017]”形。秦代文字中“禦”字又改从“御”声。“御”字是在“卸”字上追加走旁,是从辵、卸声的形声字,所以“禦”字所从的基本声符并未改变。汉代文字中将秦代文字“禦”字所从的“[glyph:g018]”部分讹变为“[glyph:g019]”形。现代文字基本沿袭秦代文字的写法。参见“御”字条。(白于蓝)\\n\\n栝 huó 见纽、月部；匣纽、末韵、户括切。\\n[glyph:g020]¹一栝\\n《说文》小篆 楷书\\n[glyph:g021]\\n楷书\\n1《说文》9页。\\n形声字。从示,昏声。本义是一种祭祀。《说文》:“栝,祀也。”《集韵·换韵》:“栝,报神祭也。”“栝”字本从昏声,本应隶定为“祑”。但在现代文字中声符“昏”讹变为“舌”,与“口舌”之“舌”形同。当然,作为“栝”的异体,“祑”这种形体在后代文字中仍然保留着,如《集韵·豢韵》:“栝,或作祑。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n禖 méi 明纽、之部；明纽、灰韵、莫杯切。\\n[glyph:g022]¹一禖\\n《说文》小篆 楷书\\n1《说文》9页。\\n形声字。从示,某声。本义是一种祭名,指求子之祭。《说文》:“禖,祭也。”段玉裁注:“谓祭名也。”《玉篇·示部》:“禖,求子祭。”引申之又指求子所祭之神。《汉书·戾太子传》:“上年二十九乃得太子,甚喜,为立禖,使东方朔、枚皋作禖祝。”颜师古注:“禖,求子之神也。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n挀 shēn 禅纽、真部；禅纽、轸韵、时忍切。\\n[glyph:g023]¹一挀\\n《说文》小篆 楷书\\n[glyph:g024]\\n楷书\\n1《说文》9页。\\n11\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"小篆“禳”字，左示右襄\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“禳”字，左示右襄\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"小篆“禪”字，左示右單\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“禪”字，左示右單\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"甲骨文“御/禦”字初形1\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g006\", \"description\": \"甲骨文“御/禦”字初形2\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g007\", \"description\": \"甲骨文加示旁的“禦”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g008\", \"description\": \"西周金文“禦”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g009\", \"description\": \"小篆“禦”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g010\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“禦”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g011\", \"description\": \"文中引述甲骨文字形“卸/禦”其一\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g012\", \"description\": \"文中引述甲骨文字形“卸/禦”其二\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g013\", \"description\": \"文中引述甲骨文字形“卩”像人跪拜之形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g014\", \"description\": \"文中引述甲骨文“午”字形其一\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g015\", \"description\": \"文中引述甲骨文“午”字形其二\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g016\", \"description\": \"文中引述西周“午”字形变\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g017\", \"description\": \"文中引述西周“禦”字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g018\", \"description\": \"秦代文字“禦”所从御旁中的辵/彳形小篆或古文字偏旁\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g019\", \"description\": \"汉代文字中讹变出的偏旁形体\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g020\", \"description\": \"小篆“栝/祑”字，左示右昏\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g021\", \"description\": \"楷书异体字，左示右昏（祑）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g022\", \"description\": \"小篆“禖”字，左示右某\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g023\", \"description\": \"小篆“挀/𥛱”字，左示右辰\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g024\", \"description\": \"楷书异体字，左示右辰（𥛱）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n24:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:000024\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 24, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"277ee0341fa7f4adda4ae30ceb94ce74435130cdb57396105b5bf3e36aa95bfe\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"8eaf10935bd19505454e6677a5049d9f407d2d41cbeeb4cefd554ad230024f03\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"示部 三部\\n\\n形声字。从示,辰声。本义是指古代帝王祭祀社稷之神时所用的生肉。这种生肉盛放在海蚌里,祭后要分赐给同姓诸侯。《说文》:“脤,社肉,盛以蜃,故谓之脤。天子所以亲遗同姓。《春秋》传曰:‘石尚来归脤。’”《玉篇·示部》:“脤,祭社生肉也。”“脤”本是一种生肉,所以“脤”字又有从肉、辰声的“脄”为异体。《玉篇·肉部》:“以脤膰之礼,亲兄弟之国,皆社祭宗庙之肉也。”《周礼·春官·大宗伯》:“以脤膰之礼,亲兄弟之国。”贾公彦疏:“分而言之,则脤是社祭之肉,膰是宗庙之肉。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n禡(祃) mà 明纽、鱼部;明纽、杩韵、莫驾切。\\n[glyph:g001]¹—禡—祃\\n《说文》小篆 楷书 楷书\\n1《说文》9页。\\n形声字。从示,马声。本义是一种军中祭名。古时于军队驻扎之处设祭祭神曰禡。《说文》:“禡,师行所止,恐有慢其神,下而祀之日禡。”《玉篇·示部》:“禡,师祭也。”《礼记·王制》:“禡于所征之地。”郑玄注:“禡,师祭也。为兵祷。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n社 shè 禅纽、鱼部;禅纽、马韵、常者切。\\n[glyph:g002]¹—[glyph:g003]²—[glyph:g004]³—[glyph:g005]⁴—社\\n商 战国 《说文》小篆 汉 楷书\\n1《甲文编》518页。2《金文编》16页。3《说文》9页。4《篆隶表》13页。\\n会意字。从示,从土。本义是指土地之神。《吕氏春秋·季冬》:“以供皇天上 whistle 社稷之享。”高诱注:“社,后土之神。”《白虎通·社稷》:“社者,土地之神也。”中山王璺鼎:“身勤袪(社)稷(稷)。”“袪(社)”亦指土地之神。甲骨文中以“[glyph:g006](土)”为“社”。《殷墟书契前编》4.17.3:“贞:勿乘年于封土。”“封土”即“封社”。“社”字应即“土”字之孳乳分化字。参“土”字条。(白于蓝)\\n\\n禓 yáng 喻纽、阳部;以纽、阳韵、与章切。\\n[glyph:g007]¹—禓\\n《说文》小篆 楷书\\n1《说文》9页。\\n形声字。从示,昜声。本义是指道上之祭。《说文》:“禓,道上祭。”《急就篇》第二十五章:“谒禓塞祷鬼神宠。”颜师古注:“禓,道上之祭也。”引申之又指路神。《广韵·阳韵》:“禓,道神。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n祲 jǐn 精纽、侵部;精纽、侵韵、子心切。\\njìn 精纽、侵部;精纽、沁韵、子鸩切。\\n[glyph:g008]¹—祲\\n《说文》小篆 楷书\\n1《说文》9页。\\n形声字。从示,侵省声。本义是指阴阳之气相侵所形成的不祥的妖气。《说文》:“祲,精气感祥。”《集韵·寝韵》:“祲,妖气。”《左传·昭公十五年》:“吾见赤黑之祲,非祭祥也,丧氛也。”杜预注:“祲,妖氛也。”引申之则指灾祸。《续资治通鉴·宋理宗端平二年》:“灾祲饥馑,史不绝书。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n禍(祸) huò 匣纽、歌部;匣纽、果韵、胡果切。\\n[glyph:g009]¹—[glyph:g010]²—[glyph:g011]³—禍—祸\\n战国 《说文》小篆 汉 楷书 楷书\\n1《金文编》16页。2《说文》9页。3《篆隶表》13页。\\n形声字。从示,咼声。本义是指灾害、灾难。《说文》:“禍,害也。”中山王璺壶:“隹(惟)逆生祸,佳(惟)思(顺)生福。”参“咼”字条。(白于蓝)\\n\\n祟 suì 心纽、物部;心纽、至韵、虽遂切。\\n[glyph:g012]¹ ┰ [glyph:g014]³—[glyph:g015]⁴—[glyph:g016]⁵—祟\\n商 ┠ 西周 战国 《说文》小篆 楷书\\n[glyph:g013]² ┚\\n商\\n1、2《甲文编》12页。3《金文编》194页“叡”字所从。4《战文编》8页。5《说文》9页。\\n会意字。始见于甲骨文,从示,从木,会燃木于示前卜问神祇之意。引申之则指鬼神为祸。《说文》:“祟,神祸也。”《庄子·天道》:“其鬼不祟。”“祟”字在战国时期,所从之“木”旁讹变为“[glyph:g017]”,至秦代文字中又进一步讹变为“出”,至楷书中则变为“出”,与“进出”之“出”字形同。(白于蓝)\\n\\n12\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0024/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0024/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0024/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“禡”字，从示从馬\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0024/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"甲骨文“社”字，象土堆或神主之形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0024/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"战国文字“社”字，从示从土\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0024/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“社”字，从示从土\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0024/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“社”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0024/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g006\", \"description\": \"甲骨文“土”字，作土堆形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0024/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g007\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“禓”字，从示从昜\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0024/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g008\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“祲”字，从示侵省声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0024/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g009\", \"description\": \"战国文字“禍”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0024/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g010\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“禍”字，从示咼声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0024/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g011\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“禍”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0024/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g012\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文“祟”字（形一），从示从木\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0024/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g013\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文“祟”字（形二），从木在示上，有示形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0024/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g014\", \"description\": \"西周金文“祟”字（“叡”字所从），从木从示\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0024/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g015\", \"description\": \"战国文字“祟”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0024/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g016\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“祟”字，从示从出（或木省变）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0024/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g017\", \"description\": \"战国文字“祟”字中所从“木”讹变之形，类似两重折角带点\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0024/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n25:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:000025\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 25, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"67cb60b14aa697bbb5d4afe915d2f979a53c1ff6fb55fe15a96c680e762f33f1\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"1a1738ed871938d38cfaa14e51d4ce9904661e58ad7b722a43f8e72d2ea18783\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"禡 社 禚 禤 禍 崇 禊 禁 祧 祚 禊 三\\n\\n祅 yāo 影组、宵部；影组、宵韵、於乔切。\\n\\n[glyph:g001]¹ 《说文》小篆 —┬— 袄 楷书\\n                ├— 祅 楷书\\n                └— 妖 楷书\\n\\n1《说文》9页。\\n    形声字。从示，笑声。本义是指一切反常怪异的事物或现象。《说文》：“地反物为祅也。”“祅”字或作“袄”，也作“妖”。段玉裁注：“袄，省作祅。经传通作妖。”《集韵·宵韵》：“袄，《说文》：‘地反物为袄。’或省，通作妖。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n禁 jìn 见组、侵部；见组、沁韵、居荫切。\\n\\n[glyph:g002]¹ 《说文》小篆 — [glyph:g003]² 汉 — 禁 楷书\\n\\n1《说文》9页。2《篆隶表》13页。\\n    会意字。从示，林声。本义是指忌讳。《说文》：“禁，吉凶之忌也。”《汉书·艺文志》：“及拘者为之，则牵于禁忌，泥阴于小数，舍人事而任鬼神。”引申之指禁止、制止。《广雅·释诂三》：“禁，止也。”《礼记·王制》：“林麓川泽以时入而不禁。”孔颖达疏：“禁谓防遏。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n祧 tiāo 透组、宵部；透组、萧韵、吐雕切。\\n\\n[glyph:g004]¹ 《说文》新附 — 祧 楷书\\n\\n1《说文》9页。\\n    形声字。从示，兆声。本义是指帝王远祖、始祖之庙。《玉篇·示部》：“祧，远庙也。”《礼记·祭法》：“远庙为祧。”孙希旦集解：“盖谓高祖之父、高祖之祖之庙也。”古代帝王对其世次疏远之祖，依制迁去神主藏于祧。《周礼·春官·守祧》：“守祧掌守先王先公之庙祧。”郑玄注：“迁主所藏曰祧。”《说文》：“祧，迁庙也。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n祚 zuò 从组、铎部；从组、暮韵、昨误切。\\n\\n[glyph:g005]¹ 战国 — [glyph:g006]² 《说文》新附 — [glyph:g007]³ 汉 — 祚 楷书\\n\\n1《楚系简帛》28页。2《说文》9页。3《篆隶表》14页。\\n    形声字。从示，乍声。本义是指福。《说文》：“祚，福也。”引申之又指赐福。《左传·宣公三年》：“天祚明德，有所底止。”又指帝位。《广韵·暮韵》：“祚，位也。”《史记·秦楚之际月表》：“拔乱诛暴，平定海内，卒践帝祚，成于汉家。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n禊 xì 溪组、月部；匣组、霁韵、胡计切。\\n\\n    形声字。从示，契声。古代民俗于三月上旬巳日于水滨设祭，祓除不祥。《史记·外戚世家》：“武帝禊霸上还。”裴骃集解引徐广曰：“三月上巳，临水祓除谓之禊。”《广韵·霁韵》：“禊，祓除不祥也。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n三 部\\n\\n三 sān 心组、侵部；心组、谈韵、苏甘切。\\n\\n[glyph:g008]¹ 商 — [glyph:g009]² 西周 —┬— [glyph:g010]³ 战国\\n                     ├— [glyph:g011]⁴ 战国 — [glyph:g012]⁶ 《说文》小篆 — [glyph:g013]⁷ 汉 — 三 楷书\\n                     └— [glyph:g014]⁵ 《说文》古文 — [glyph:g015]⁸ 汉\\n\\n1《甲文编》14页。2《金文编》18页。3《古文典》1418页。4《战文编》14页。5、6《说文》9页。7、8《篆隶表》14页。\\n    指事字。本义是数词，即二加一为三。《庄子·齐物论》：“二与一为三。”《广韵·谈韵》：“三，数名。”又表示序数第三。《书·洪范》：“五行：一曰水，二曰火，三曰木……”引申之又泛指多数。《论语·公冶长》：“季文子三思而后行。”刘宝楠正义：“三思者，言思之多，能审慎也。”“三”字本用三横表示数量，战国文字中或在原形上追加“戈”或“弋”为繁形，其中加“弋”之形一直沿袭至汉代。甲骨文“三”字作“三”，三横等长，“气”字作“三”，中间一横较上下两横短，二字是有严格区分的。(白于蓝)\\n\\n13\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0025/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0025/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0025/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“祅”字，左示右夭\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0025/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“禁”字，上林下示\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0025/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书/篆隶“禁”字，上林下示\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0025/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"《说文》新附小篆“祧”字，左示右兆\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0025/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"战国楚系文字“祚”字，左示右乍\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0025/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g006\", \"description\": \"《说文》新附小篆“祚”字，左示右乍\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0025/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g007\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书/篆隶“祚”字，左示右乍\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0025/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g008\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文“三”字，三横等长\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0025/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g009\", \"description\": \"西周金文“三”字，三横等长\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0025/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g010\", \"description\": \"战国文字“三”字，三横上加戈/弋构件\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0025/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g011\", \"description\": \"战国文字“三”字，三横形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0025/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g012\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“三”字，三横形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0025/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g013\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“三”字，三横形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0025/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g014\", \"description\": \"《说文》古文“三”字，三横加弋形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0025/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g015\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“弎”字，从弋从三\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0025/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n26:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:000026\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 26, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"4f4ce8c96008ba812b1269badd51a926949a57664dc4d8d5df40426387404e1e\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"1a2f45bede16c055572c7fb039db0bd21059c372ffda13be5886f6e5d57d97a4\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"王部 玉部\\n\\n王部\\n\\n王 wáng 匣组、阳部；云组、阳韵、雨方切。\\nwàng 匣组、阳部；云组、漾韵、于放切。\\n\\n[glyph:g001] 商 1 - [glyph:g002] 商 2 - [glyph:g003] 商 3 - [glyph:g004] 西周 4 - [glyph:g005] 春秋 5 - [glyph:g006] 战国 7 / [glyph:g007] 战国 6 - [glyph:g008] 《说文》小篆 8 - [glyph:g009] 汉 9 - 王 楷书\\n\\n1、2、3《甲文编》15页。4、5、7《金文编》18、20页。6《战文编》14页。8《说文》9页。9《篆隶表》15页。\\n\\n象形字。甲骨文作“[glyph:g010]”，像斧钺之形（由“[glyph:g011]”演变）。以斧钺象征王权。本义是指古代最高统治者。《说文》：“王，天下所归往也。”《尔雅·释诂上》：“王，君也。”《礼记·内则》：“后王命冢宰，降德于众兆民。”陆德明释文：“王，天子也。”这种意思的“王”今天读wáng。“王”字引申之又有统治之意。《诗·大雅·皇矣》：“王此大邦，克顺克比。”《史记·项羽本纪》：“先破秦入咸阳者王之。”即其例。这种意义的“王”今天读wàng。甲骨文早期“王”字作“[glyph:g012]”，后在其上缀加一横，作“[glyph:g013]”，至晚期则将“[glyph:g014]”所从之“[glyph:g015]”省减为一“[glyph:g016]”，“王”字构形便与我们今天楷书中的“王”字一样了。春秋战国时期，南方楚国及吴越地区的“王”字上或缀加鸟形，这种书体过去称为“鸟虫书”，所加鸟形乃装饰性符号，纯粹为了美观，并无实在意义。秦代小篆中“王”字和“玉”字的形体十分接近（“玉”字作“王”），但仍有区分，“王”字中间一横略微靠上，“玉”字则中间一横处于正中位置，参“玉”字条。（白于蓝）\\n\\n閏（闰） rùn 日组、真部；日组、稕韵、如顺切。\\n\\n[glyph:g017] 战国 1 - [glyph:g018] 《说文》小篆 2 - [glyph:g019] 汉 3 - 閏 楷书 - 闰 楷书\\n\\n1《楚系简帛》41页。2《说文》9页。3《篆隶表》15页。\\n\\n会意字。从王在门中以表示“闰月”之“闰”。《说文》：“闰，余分之月，五岁再闰。告朔之礼，天子居宗庙，闰月居门中。从王在门中。《周礼》曰：‘闰月，王居门中，终月也。’”本义是历法术语。农历一年与地球公转一周相比，约差十日有奇，所余的时间约三年积成一月，加在一年里，这样的办法叫做“闰”。《书·尧典》：“以闰月定四时成岁。”孔传：“一岁有余十二日，未盈三岁足得一月，则置闰焉。”《广韵·稕韵》：“闰，余也。《易》曰：‘五岁再闰。’《史记》曰：‘黄帝起消息，正闰余。’《汉书音义》曰：‘以岁之余为闰。’”（白于蓝）\\n\\n皇 huáng 匣组、阳部；匣组、唐韵、胡光切。\\n\\n[glyph:g020] 商 1 - [glyph:g021] 商 2 - [glyph:g022] 西周 3 - [glyph:g023] 春秋 4 - [glyph:g024] 战国 5 / [glyph:g025] 战国 6 - [glyph:g026] 《说文》小篆 7 - [glyph:g027] 汉 8 - 皇 楷书\\n\\n1、2《甲文编》906页。3、4、5《金文编》21~23页。6《战文编》15页。7《说文》10页。8《篆隶表》15页。\\n\\n象形字。始见于甲骨文，本像火炬光焰上腾之形，即“煌”字初文。“皇”字古有大义。《说文》：“皇，大也。”中山王鼎壶：“邵公皇工（功）。”“皇功”即“大功”。又可指天。《广韵·唐韵》：“皇，天也。”又可指君主。《尔雅·释诂上》：“皇，君也。”甲骨文“皇”字作“[glyph:g028]”，又作“[glyph:g029]”，附加音符“王”。西周金文作“[glyph:g030]”，将“王”字的一竖笔与“[glyph:g031]”下部的一竖笔连为一体，这种现象在古文字中称“借笔”或“兼笔”。春秋文字作“[glyph:g032]”，将“王”字从原形体中独立出来。战国文字承袭西周、春秋文字，但上部讹变为“[glyph:g033]”形者。秦代小篆上部又讹变为“[glyph:g034]（自）”，即《说文》所谓：“皇，大也。从自。自，始也。始皇者，三皇，大君也。自，读若鼻，今俗以始生子为鼻子。”汉代文字则将上部又讹变为“白”，一直沿袭至今。（白于蓝）\\n\\n玉部\\n\\n玉 yù 疑组、屋部；疑组、烛韵、鱼欲切。\\n\\n[glyph:g035] 商 1 - [glyph:g036] 商 2 - [glyph:g037] 西周 3 - [glyph:g038] 春秋 4 - [glyph:g039] 战国 5 / [glyph:g040] 战国 6 / [glyph:g041] 战国 7 / [glyph:g042] 战国 8 - [glyph:g043] 《说文》小篆 9 - [glyph:g044] 汉 10 / [glyph:g045] 汉 11 / [glyph:g046] 汉 12 - 玉 楷书\\n\\n14\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0026/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0026/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0026/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"甲骨文“王”字早期形体，斧钺之形，两横一竖底端为扁弧形刃\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catali