"description\": \"汉代隶书“球”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0028/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g009\", \"description\": \"小篆“璆”字（《说文》或体）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0028/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g010\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“璆”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0028/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g011\", \"description\": \"小篆“琳”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0028/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g012\", \"description\": \"西周金文“璧”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0028/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g013\", \"description\": \"春秋金文“璧”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0028/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g014\", \"description\": \"战国文字“璧”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0028/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g015\", \"description\": \"小篆“璧”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0028/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g016\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“璧”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0028/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g017\", \"description\": \"战国文字“瑗”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0028/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g018\", \"description\": \"小篆“瑗”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0028/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g019\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“瑗”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0028/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n29:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:000029\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 29, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"8d547a661af5c23bc4cf7285b98423e93ef7dbcd6e7c195de8bddf76411e8073\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"cdf16cc8b48d9cc52b87eef7c8557db07eedecbaf635528c75710eab637c8b8a\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"瓖 瑛 璿 球 琳 璧 瑗 環 璜 琮 琥 琬 璋 琰\\n\\n隶表》18页。\\n形声字。从玉,爱声。本义是指一种孔大边小的璧。《说文》:“瑗,大孔璧。”《尔雅·释器》:“肉倍好谓之璧,好倍肉谓之瑗。”郭璞注:“孔大而边小。”《荀子·大略》:“问士以璧,召人以瑗。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n環(环) huán 匣纽、元部;匣纽、删韵、户关切。\\n[glyph:g001]¹—[glyph:g002]²—[glyph:g003]³—[glyph:g004]⁴—環—环\\n西周 战国 《说文》小篆 汉 楷书 楷书\\n1《金文编》25页。2《楚系简帛》42页。3《说文》11页。4《篆隶表》18页。\\n形声字。从玉,嬛声。本义是指边与孔等同的璧。《说文》:“環,璧也。肉好若一谓之环。”《尔雅·释器》:“肉倍好谓之璧,好倍肉谓之瑗,肉好若一谓之环。”引申之则泛指圆圈形物,如耳环、门环等。(白于蓝)\\n\\n璜 huáng 匣纽、阳部;匣纽、唐韵、胡光切。\\n[glyph:g005]¹—[glyph:g006]²—[glyph:g007]³—[glyph:g008]⁴—璜\\n西周 战国 《说文》小篆 汉 楷书\\n1《金文编》25页。2《楚系简帛》44页。3《说文》11页。4《篆隶表》18页。\\n形声字。从玉,黄声。本义是指一种玉质礼器,像璧的一半,在朝聘、祭祀、丧葬时使用。《说文》:“璜,半璧也。”《周礼·春官·大宗伯》:“以玄璜礼北方。”郑玄注:“半璧曰璜。”望山二号墓竹简:“一双璜。”即指一对玉璜。(白于蓝)\\n\\n琮 cóng 从纽、冬部;从纽、冬韵、藏宗切。\\n[glyph:g009]¹—[glyph:g010]²—琮\\n《说文》小篆 汉 楷书\\n1《说文》11页。2《篆隶表》18页。\\n形声字。从玉,宗声。本义是指一种玉质礼器。方形,也有作长筒形者,中有圆孔。《说文》:“琮,瑞玉。”《周礼·春官·大宗伯》:“以玉作六器,以礼天地四方:以苍璧礼天,以黄琮礼地。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n琥 hǔ 晓纽、鱼部;晓纽、姥韵、呼古切。\\n[glyph:g011]¹—[glyph:g012]²—琥\\n战国 《说文》小篆 楷书\\n1《楚系简帛》44页。2《说文》11页。\\n形声字。从玉,虎声。本义是指古时发兵的虎符。《说文》:“琥,发兵瑞玉。为虎文。”又指古代的一种礼器。《周礼·春官·大宗伯》:“以玉作六器,以礼天地四方……以白琥礼西方。”《周礼·秋官·小行人》:“琥以绣。”郑玄注:“子、男于诸侯则享用琥璜,下其瑞也。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n琬 wǎn 影纽、元部;影纽、阮韵、於阮切。\\n[glyph:g013]¹—[glyph:g014]²—琬\\n《说文》小篆 汉 楷书\\n1《说文》11页。2《篆隶表》18页。\\n形声字。从玉,宛声。本义是指一种上端浑圆而无棱角的圭。《说文》:“琬,圭有琬者。”《集韵·换韵》:“琬,圭名。”《周礼·考工记·玉人》:“琬圭九寸而缫。”郑玄注:“琬,犹圆也。王使之瑞节也。诸侯有德,王命赐之,使者执琬圭以致命焉。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n璋 zhāng 章纽、阳部;章纽、阳韵、诸良切。\\n[glyph:g015]¹—[glyph:g016]²—[glyph:g017]³—[glyph:g018]⁴—璋\\n春秋 战国 《说文》小篆 汉 楷书\\n1《金文编》24页。2《战文编》16页。3《说文》11页。4《篆隶表》19页。\\n形声字。从玉,章声。本义是一种古瑞玉名称,形如半圭。《说文》:“璋,剡上为圭,半圭为璋。”《诗·小雅·斯干》:“载弄之璋。”毛传:“半圭曰璋。”《周礼·春官·大宗伯》:“以玉作六器,以礼天地四方……以赤璋礼南方。”“璋”字古又有明义。《玉篇·玉部》:“璋,明也。”《白虎通·文质》:“璋之为言明也。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n琰 yǎn 喻纽、谈部;以纽、琰韵、以冉切。\\n[glyph:g019]¹—[glyph:g020]²—琰\\n《说文》小篆 汉 楷书\\n1《说文》11页。2《篆隶表》19页。\\n形声字。从玉,炎声。本义是一种美玉名称,通称“琬琰”。《说文》:“琰,璧上起美色也。”徐锴系传:“琰亦美色之玉也。”《广韵·琰韵》:“琰,玉名。”《楚辞·远游》:“吸飞泉之微液兮,怀琬琰之华英。”《汉书·司马相\\n17\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0029/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0029/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0029/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"西周金文“環”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0029/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"战国楚简“環”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0029/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“環”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0029/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“環”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0029/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\