b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 1254, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"d76bee678877b6b8d150369e3d91bee10f9374c4d85ce7c74f98c6f76957c9fe\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"0e265a8306f3b983ff4251a9bf05aa1c0a26a2540980b523d3f023bcdc08c097\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"勹 与 儿 凭 尻 処 且 俎\\n\\n尻即居,凭从而坐谓之尻。(周宝宏)\\n\\n処 chǔ 昌纽、鱼部;昌纽、语韵、昌与切。\\n\\n[glyph:g001] 西周 [glyph:g002] 西周 [glyph:g003] 《说文》或体 [glyph:g004] 战国 [glyph:g005] 战国 [glyph:g006] 秦 [glyph:g007] 汉 [glyph:g008] 汉 [glyph:g009] 楷书 処 楷书 処 楷书\\n[glyph:g010] 《说文》小篆\\n\\n1、2《金文编》922页。3、4《说文》299页。5、6《战文编》924页。7、8、9《篆隶表》1015页。\\n\\n会意字。《说文》:“処,止也,得几而止,从几从夂。處,処或从虍声。”段玉裁注:“人遇几而止,引申之为凡尻处之字。”西周金文井委钟:“宪宪圣爽,處处于宗室。”臣谏簋:“诞令臣谏以□□亚旅处于纸。”墙盘:“静幽高祖,在微雷处。”《诗·小雅·采薇》:“王事靡盬,不遑启处。”郑笺:处,犹居也。《诗·大雅·桑柔》:“自西徂东,靡所定处。”《诗》中凡毛传训“止”者,皆应训“居”。上引西周金文的处字皆用为居处之意。这些西周金文和西周文献的用法可证处字的本义为居处之义。处字西周金文的形体从“[glyph:g011]”从几,[glyph:g012]形可以认为是虍字之繁,也可以认为“人”形与“虍”形的合体。因此,西周金文的处字可以认为是从人从止(倒止)从几虍声。这一形体当为处字最早的形体,并为《说文》或体及后来典籍继承。在战国时代处字已经简化为从几虍声的字,《说文》篆文“処”当是省掉虍声的形体。汉代隶书的写法是简体“処”形体讹变。(周宝宏)\\n\\n且 部\\n\\n且 qiě 清纽、鱼部;清纽、马韵、七也切。\\n\\n[glyph:g013] 商 [glyph:g014] 商 [glyph:g015] 商 [glyph:g016] 商 [glyph:g017] 西周 [glyph:g018] 西周 [glyph:g019] 春秋\\n[glyph:g020] 春秋 [glyph:g021] 《说文》小篆 [glyph:g022] 秦 [glyph:g023] 楷书 且\\n\\n1、2、3《甲文编》527~528页。4-8《金文编》923~925页。9《说文》299页。10《睡甲》209页。\\n\\n象形字。《说文》:“且,荐也,从几,足有二横,一其下地也。凡且之属皆从且。”关于“且”字的构形,《说文》学家们或据《说文》所释为说,或释为“俎”字初文,皆与甲骨文,西周金文中“且”字的用法不合,故不可信。郭沫若《甲骨文字研究·释祖妣》:“且实牡器之象形,故可省为丄,匕迺匕椆字之引申,盖以牝器似匕,故以匕为妣若牝也。”商周社会流行祖先崇拜,甲骨文,西周金文祖字即作“且”,而“且”字代表的是男性祖先。在原始社会流行男性生殖器崇拜,考古中多有发现,其形状与甲骨文和西周金文且(祖)字作“且”形相同,可证郭沫若之说。总之,且是祖先之祖的初文,是男性生殖器的象形。(周宝宏)\\n\\n俎 zǔ 精纽、鱼部;庄纽、语韵、侧吕切。\\n\\n[glyph:g024] 西周 [glyph:g025] 西周 [glyph:g026] 战国 [glyph:g027] 战国 [glyph:g028] 《说文》小篆 [glyph:g029] 秦 [glyph:g030] 汉\\n[glyph:g031] 汉 [glyph:g032] 汉 [glyph:g033] 楷书 俎\\n\\n1、2《金文编》925页。3、4《战文编》925页。5《说文》299页。6《睡甲》209页。7、8、9《篆隶表》1016页。\\n\\n形声字。《说文》:“俎,礼俎也。从半肉在且上。”《说文》及《说文》学家们释“俎”字字形有误,但训其本义则是。于豪亮《说组字》:“三年瘛壶其铭文是:‘隹(惟)三年九月丁巳,王才(在)奠(郑),鄉醴。乎(呼)虢叔召瘛,易(赐)隻[glyph:g034]。已丑,王才(在)旬陵,鄉逆酉(酒)。乎(呼)师寿召瘛,易(赐)彘[glyph:g035]。……’‘[glyph:g036]’彘就是豕。《方言·八》:‘猪,北燕朝鲜之间谓之豭,关东西或谓之彘,或谓之豕。’……因为彘是豕,所以彘俎就是豕俎。豕俎在《仪礼》和《礼记》中常见。……由于《仪礼》和《礼记》多见豕俎,可以证明豕俎就是彘俎,从而也就证明了[glyph:g037]就是俎字。”王人聪《释西周金文的“俎”字》:“香港徐氏艺术馆藏有一件春秋时期的郑太子孙壶,此器未经著录。……现将壶铭释录如下:隹正月月初吉壬申,余郑太子之孙口兵择余吉金,自作宗彝,其用享用孝于我皇[glyph:g038]文考,不敢春秋岁……至于子子孙孙参拜稽首于皇考剌[glyph:g039],卑迈世无期,亟于后民,永宝教之。壶铭第七行第三字及倒数第三行第二字,其字形结构与三年瘛壶的[glyph:g040]字相同,可知即系一字。由壶铭的上下文义,亦可知此字当读为‘祖’,壶铭云‘我皇[glyph:g041]文考’,即‘我皇祖文考’;‘剌[glyph:g042]’即‘剌祖’。于此又可知[glyph:g043]字在此假借为‘祖’。再联系瘛壶‘彘俎’之词义,即可证知[glyph:g044]及此壶之[glyph:g045],当即与‘祖’音同的‘俎’字。”“伍士谦云:‘按《殷周青铜器通论》图版四殷饕餮蝉纹俎,象两足之几,俎面为矩形,侧视之正为[glyph:g046]或[glyph:g047]形。俎字之[glyph:g048],当即迫之[glyph:g049]之讹变,\\n\\n1239\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1254/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1254/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1254/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"西周金文“处”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1254/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"西周金文“处”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1254/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"《说文》或体“處”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1254/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"战国文字“处”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1254/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"战国文字“处”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1254/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g006\", \"description\": \"秦代文字“处”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1254/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g007\", \"description\": \"汉代文字“处”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1254/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g008\", \"description\": \"汉代文字“处”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1254/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g009\", \"description\": \"楷书“处”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1254/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g010\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“処”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1254/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g011\", \"description\": \"西周金文“处”字偏旁构件（虎人合体/虎之繁形）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1254/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g012\", \"description\": \"西周金文“处”字偏旁构件（虎人合体/虎之繁形）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1254/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g013\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文“且”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1254/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g014\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文“且”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1254/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g015\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文“且”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1254/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g016\", \"description\": \"商代金文“且”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1254/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g017\", \"description\": \"西周金文“且”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1254/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g018\", \"description\": \"西周金文“且”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1254/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g019\", \"description\": \"春秋金文“且”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1254/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g020\", \"description\": \"春秋金文“且”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1254/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g021\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“且”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1254/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g022\", \"description\": \"秦代简牍文字“且”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1254/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g023\", \"description\": \"楷书“且”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1254/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g024\", \"description\": \"西周金文“俎”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1254/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g025\", \"description\": \"西周金文“俎”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-