（16）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1260/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g030\", \"description\": \"車字西周金文（17）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1260/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g031\", \"description\": \"卜辞中车字象形之一\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1260/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g032\", \"description\": \"卜辞中车字象形之二（有车箱）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1260/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g033\", \"description\": \"卜辞中车字象形之三（有双轭）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1260/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g034\", \"description\": \"金文中省一轮之车字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1260/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g035\", \"description\": \"西周金文全形车字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1260/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g036\", \"description\": \"西周金文省形车字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1260/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g037\", \"description\": \"軒字战国古文（1）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-12