xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n1263:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:001263\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 1263, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"ad94592cc7384565aa535e1280db3dcd5f9d63a72b209cb04032c0c3c49e44b1\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"c04f114ff643bd309aebaae980b406675164a932f427c114e3123298ddc8da28\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"車部\\n\\n較 (较) jué 见纽、药部;见纽、觉韵、古岳切。\\n\\n[glyph:g001]¹—[glyph:g002]²—[glyph:g003]³—較—较\\n西周 《说文》小篆 汉 楷书 楷书\\n\\n1《金文编》932页。2《说文》301页。3《篆隶表》1023页。\\n形声字。清徐灏《说文段注笺》:“舆前横木谓之轼,左右两厢谓之骑,骑上谓之较。郑玄《考工记》曰:较,两骑上出轼者是也。依《考工记》尺度,轼高三尺三寸,较高五尺五寸,较与骑相交合而出于轼上,故谓之较。”《诗·卫风·淇奥》:“宽兮绰兮,倚重较兮。”清马瑞辰《毛诗传笺通释》:“车骑上之木为较,较上更饰以曲钩若重起者然,是为重较。”张舜徽《说文解字约注》:“凡言计较、比较,当以斛为本字,斛较音同,故相通假。”(周宝宏)\\n\\n輒 (辄) zhé 端纽、葉部;知纽、葉韵、陟葉切。\\n\\n[glyph:g004]¹—[glyph:g005]²—[glyph:g006]³—[glyph:g007]⁴—[glyph:g008]⁵—輒—辄\\n战国 《说文》小篆 秦 秦 汉 楷书 楷书\\n\\n1《战文编》932页。2《说文》301页。3、4《睡甲》210页。5《篆隶表》1023页。\\n形声字。《说文》:“辄,车两骑也。从車,聃声。”段玉裁注:“车两骑谓之辄,按:车必有两骑,如人必有两耳,故从聃,耳,耳垂也。”用为副词,意如“则”,为借用。(周宝宏)\\n\\n𫐄 (𫐄) chūn 章纽、文部;章纽、谆韵、章伦切。\\n\\n[glyph:g009]¹—[glyph:g010]²—𫐄—𫐄\\n秦 《说文》小篆 楷书 楷书\\n\\n1《篆隶表》1023页。2《说文》301页。\\n形声字。《说文》:“𫐄,车约𫐄也。从車,川声。《周礼》孤乘夏𫐄,一曰下棺车曰𫐄。”段玉裁注:“许意盖谓𫐄、闱、棁等皆有物缠束之谓之约𫐄,以赤画之谓之夏𫐄,蝉虽赤画而约谓之夏𫐄。𫐄之言巡也,巡绕之词。”此为𫐄字本义,用为古代泥泞路上的交通工具。用为巡视之“巡”是其假借义。又指葬车。(周宝宏)\\n\\n輅(辂) líng 来纽、真部;来纽、青韵、郎丁切。\\n\\n[glyph:g011]¹—[glyph:g012]²—[glyph:g013]³—[glyph:g014]⁴—輅—辂\\n《说文》小篆 汉 汉 汉 楷书 楷书\\n\\n1《说文》301页。2、3《篆隶表》1023~1024页。4《马王堆》575页。\\n形声字。《说文》:“輅,车辐间横木。从車,令声。𨎡,輅或从霝,司马相如说。”段玉裁注:“车墙间,蒙上文言之,犹言车舆间也。木部曰:横,阑木也。车墙间横木谓车骑之直者,衡者也。轼与骑皆以木一横一直为方格,成之如今之大方格然。《楚辞》:倚结輅兮长太息,涕潺缓兮下霑轼。戴先生曰:輅者,轼较下纵横木总名。”(周宝宏)\\n\\n轄 (辖) qūn 溪纽、文部;溪纽、真韵、去伦切。\\nyǐn\\n\\n[glyph:g015]¹—轄—辖\\n《说文》小篆 楷书 楷书\\n\\n1《说文》301页。\\n形声字。《说文》:“辖,轺车前横木也。从車,君声。”段玉裁注:“轺车前横木也,轺车,小车也,木部曰:横,阑木也。轺车前横木谓小车轼骑之直者衡者也。”此读yǐn。作“车轴”、“车轴相连”义读qūn。(周宝宏)\\n\\n軫 (轸) zhěn 章纽、文部;章纽、轸韵、章忍切。\\n\\n[glyph:g016]¹—[glyph:g017]²—[glyph:g018]³—[glyph:g019]⁴—[glyph:g020]⁵—[glyph:g021]⁶—軫—轸\\n西周 战国 《说文》小篆 秦 汉 汉 楷书 楷书\\n\\n1《金文编》932页。2《战文编》932页。3《说文》301页。4《睡甲》211页。5、6《篆隶表》1024页。\\n形声字。《说文》:“轸,车后横木也。从車,㐱声。”王筠句读:“戴侗曰:轸,舆下四面木匡,合成舆者也。《考工记》曰:轸之方也以象地也。……按:轸乃四面木,独以为舆后横木者非也。使轸独为舆后横木则不得言方以象地。”徐灏段注笺:“按戴说精确不易,许郑以为舆后横木,为误会左氏之文。《昭二十一年传》:张句抽殳而下,子成射之,折股,句扶服而击之,折轸。此但指舆后一面而浑言之。阮太傅曰:舆左右前三面皆有版,人所不常指名,所指名为轸者,唯舆后耳。”(周宝宏)\\n\\n1248\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1263/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1263/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1263/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"西周金文“較”，从車从交\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1263/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“較”，从車交声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1263/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“較”\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1263/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"战国文字“輒”，从車从聃\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1263/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“輒”，从車聃声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1263/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g006\", \"description\": \"秦代简帛文字“輒”\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1263/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g007\", \"description\": \"秦代简帛文字“輒”，另一形体\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1263/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g008\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“輒”\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1263/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g009\", \"description\": \"秦代文字“𫐄”，从車川声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1263/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g010\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“𫐄”，从車川声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1263/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g011\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“輅”，从車令声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1263/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g012\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“輅”\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1263/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g013\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“輅”，第二种形体\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1263/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g014\", \"description\": \"马王堆汉简帛文字“輅”\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1263/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g015\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“轄”，从車君声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1263/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g016\", \"description\": \"西周金文“軫”，从車从㐱\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etym