文字，左阜右舀\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1273/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g019\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书字形，左阜右舀\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1273/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g020\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书字形，左阜右舀\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1273/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g021\", \"description\": \"甲骨文古体，兽形从凵（陷猪或豕形）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1273/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g022\", \"description\": \"甲骨文古体，鹿形从凵（陷鹿形）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1273/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g023\", \"description\": \"甲骨文古体，兕或象形从凵\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1273/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g024\", \"description\": \"甲骨文古体，牛形从凵\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1273/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g025\", \"description\": \"甲骨文古体，犬或虎形从凵\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1273/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g026\", \"description\": \"小篆凵字形，两边向内作张口形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-