062cfa5cf61001e667606d771f\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"防 隄 附 陀 隔 障 隠 隈 限 隴 陝 陳 陶\\n\\n《睡甲》214页。6-9《篆隶表》1038页。\\n形声字。《说文》：“隠，蔽也。从𨸏，㥯声。”徐灏段注笺：“隠之本义盖谓隔盲不相见，引申为凡隐蔽之称。”(周宝宏)\\n\\n隈 yù 影组、觉部；影担、号韵、乌到切。\\n[glyph:g001]¹——[glyph:g002]²——隈\\n《说文》小篆 汉 楷书\\n1《说文》305页。2《篆隶表》1038页。\\n形声字。《说文》：“隈，水隈崖也。从𨸏，奥声。”段玉裁注：“厓，山边也，引申之为水边。隈厓谓曲边也。《释丘》曰：厓内为隈，外为鞹。毛诗：瞻彼淇奥。传曰：奥，隈也。奥者隈之假借字也。”王筠句读：“《释丘》：隈、隈、厓，内为隈，外为隈。”(周宝宏)\\n\\n限 wēi 影组、微部；影组、队韵、乌债切。\\n[glyph:g003]¹——限\\n《说文》小篆 楷书\\n1《说文》306页。\\n形声字。《说文》：“限，水曲，隈也。从𨸏，畏声。”朱骏声通训定声：“按字从𨸏，当训山曲澳也。隈篆当训水曲澳也。”山脉的弯曲处称隈，水流的弯曲处称隈，但典籍多水流弯曲多作隈。(周宝宏)\\n\\n隴 (陇) lǒng 来组、东部；来组、肿韵、力踵切。\\n[glyph:g004]¹——[glyph:g005]²——[glyph:g006]³——隴——陇\\n《说文》小篆 汉 汉 楷书 楷书\\n1《说文》306页。2、3《篆隶表》1038页。\\n形声字。《说文》：“隴，天水大阪也。从𨸏，龙声。”段玉裁注：“《地理志》：天水郡有陇县。《郡国志》：汉阳郡永平十七年天水郡更名也。陇县有大阪名陇坻。”(周宝宏)\\n\\n陝 (陕) shǎn 书组、谈部；书组、琰韵、失冉切。\\n[glyph:g007]¹——[glyph:g008]²——[glyph:g009]³——[glyph:g010]⁴——[glyph:g011]⁵——陝——陕\\n春秋 《说文》小篆 汉 汉 汉 楷书 楷书\\n1《战文编》947页。2《说文》306页。3、4、5《篆隶表》1039页。\\n形声字。《说文》：“陝，弘农陕也。古虢国，王季之子所封也。从𨸏，㚒声。”桂馥义证：“《隐五年公羊传》：自陕而东者周公主之，自陕而西者召公主之。注云：陕者盖今弘农陕县是也。”(周宝宏)\\n\\n陳 (陈) zhèn 定组、真部；澄组、震韵、直刃切。\\nchén 定组、真部；澄组、直韵、直珍切。\\n[glyph:g012]¹ [glyph:g013]² [glyph:g014]³\\n战国 战国 战国\\n[glyph:g015]⁴ [glyph:g016]⁵ [glyph:g017]⁶ [glyph:g018]⁷ [glyph:g019]⁸ [glyph:g020]⁹ [glyph:g021]¹⁰ [glyph:g022] [glyph:g023]\\n战国 《说文》小篆 秦 秦 汉 汉 汉 楷书 楷书\\n1-4《金文编》942页。5《说文》306页。6、7《睡甲》214页。8、9、10《篆隶表》1039页。\\n形声字。《说文》：“陳，宛丘舜后，妫满之所封。从𨸏从木申声。敶，古文陈。”按：陈字当从𨸏从东，非从木从申，战国文字中又附加“土”旁，是战国时代写字的习惯。清徐灏《说文段注笺》：“陈之本义即谓陈列，因为国名所专而后人昧其义耳。𨹬乃后制之字，段谓俗假陈为𨹬列，非也。《周礼·司命》：以陈肆辨物而平市。郑注：陈犹列也。此陈之古义。因之堂途谓之陈，军旅亦谓之陈，皆有行列者也。军旅之陈读去声(zhèn)，俗别作阵，又引申为陈说之义。盖凡言事者必条举其得失、指阵其利害，故谓之陈，又因行列而为积聚之称，所谓陈陈相因是也。……陈之本义为陈列，故从𨸏从木申声，盖于平陆中布列之义。”(周宝宏)\\n\\n陶 táo 定组、幽部；定组、豪韵、徒刀切。\\n[glyph:g024]¹ [glyph:g025]²\\n西周 西周\\n[glyph:g026]³——[glyph:g027]⁴——[glyph:g028]⁵——陶——陶\\n《说文》小篆 汉 汉 汉 楷书\\n1、2《金文编》942页。3《说文》306页。4、5、6《篆隶表》1040页。\\n形声字。《说文》：“陶，再成丘也，在济阴。从𨸏，匋声。《夏书》曰：东至于陶丘。陶丘有尧城，尧尝所居，故尧号陶唐氏。”段玉裁注：“《释丘》曰：一成为敦丘，再成\\n\\n1261\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1276/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1276/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1276/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“隈”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1276/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“隈”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1276/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“限”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1276/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“隴”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1276/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“隴”字其一\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1276/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g006\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“隴”字其二\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1276/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g007\", \"description\": \"春秋金文“陝”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1276/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g008\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“陝”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1276/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g009\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“陝”字其一\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1276/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g010\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“陝”字其二\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1276/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g011\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“陝”字其三\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1276/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g012\", \"description\": \"战国金文/文字“陳”字其一\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1276/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g013\", \"description\": \"战国金文/文字“陳”字其二\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1276/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g014\", \"description\": \"战国金文/文字“陳”字其三\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1276/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g015\", \"description\": \"战国金文/文字“陳”字其四\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1276/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\"