{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"agent_message","text":"The full size scan resolves the alleged OCR discrepancy: sequence markers 1–5 match the citation line below them, including 4 for the Shuowen seal form and 5 for the Han form. The OCR line is accurate there, so the earlier proposed correction should be withdrawn. The MOE entry also distinguishes the seal analysis (玨 plus 刀) from its explanation of how the regular form’s inner strokes are written."}}
